            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "Each entry is determined by the number of occurrences of each of the 26 letters: alphabetical order fixes their positions. Distribute 5 identical stars among 26 distinct letter bins, allowing empty bins. With 25 bars, there are 30 positions altogether.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Number of entries}&=\\binom{5+26-1}{26-1}\\\\\\text{Number of entries}&=\\binom{30}{25}=\\binom{30}{5}.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
